      "note": "Retyped from label to behaviour. SPATIAL_ADJUST.SAVE_CHANGES \"Save Changes\" is the dialog's only save button, in the footer under every tab (sa-settings-dlg.component.html:49-55). On save the dialog compares three groups with their opening values: the site settings (the Calculation and Minimum Threshold tabs), the user preferences (the Preferences tab) and the Target Profiles (sa-settings-dlg.component.ts:445-468). It sends one request per changed group, all together (:203, :482-503), and closes when they finish. With nothing changed it just closes (:196-199).",
