      "note": "Retyped from label to behaviour. Cancel (STRINGS.CANCEL) runs the same change check as Save (sa-settings-dlg.component.ts:217-229). With no edits it closes at once. With edits it opens a confirmation headed SPATIAL_ADJUST.DISCARD_CHANGES \"Discard changes\" that asks SETTINGS_CONFIRM_DISCARD_CHANGES_PRIMARY \"Are you sure you want to exit without saving changes?\" (sa-settings-dlg.component.html:261-270). Its buttons are CONTINUE_EDITING \"Continue Editing\" and DISCARD_CHANGES \"Discard changes\", both shown upper-case, so the second reads \"DISCARD CHANGES\" on screen. Continue Editing hides the confirmation and leaves the dialog open with the edits. Discard changes closes the dialog without saving anything (:235-242; the toolbar removes the dialog on cancel, sa-main-toolbar.component.html:110).",
